<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Millennium raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Millennium raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Millennium Chemicals Inc to long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said kept the intermediate-term rating as neutral.</p>
<p>-- Millennium Chemicals remained unchanged at 21-3/4.</p>
</text>
